# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AuRA release .gitignore
# Large, licensed, machine-specific or generated content never enters git.
# A pattern that ends in "/" matches only a real directory, not a symlink.
# Paths that a user may replace with a symlink (data, logs, virtual
# environments, the SDK and other third-party checkouts) therefore have no
# trailing "/": git would commit the symlink and the absolute path it stores.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/
.venv
venv
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Local configuration (copy config/aura.env.example -> config/aura.env).
# Everything in config/ except the template is ignored, including editor
# swap and backup copies of config/aura.env.
config/*
!config/aura.env.example

# Recorded data (default data root) and per-run logs
data
logs
*.log
# Default output folders of recorders run without --output-root (created in the cwd)
recording_sync_robot_*/
Anygrasp_capture_3oak_*/

# Files that commands in the docs write into the repository root
# (docs/hardware.md, docs/calibration.md, assets/README.md)
/charuco_4x5_40mm.png
/my_contacts.json
/my_fit.json

# Rig-specific calibration results are generated by the user, never shipped
calibration/*
!calibration/README.md

# Model weights
checkpoints/*
!checkpoints/README.md
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.tar

# Third-party code each user clones or builds (see docs/installation.md)
# AnyGrasp SDK, license and checkpoints are obtained by each user (see docs/anygrasp_license.md)
/third_party/anygrasp_sdk
/third_party/Grounded-SAM-2
/third_party/MinkowskiEngine
# AnyGrasp SDK, license files and binaries anywhere else in the tree (an SDK
# checkout in another folder, the license .zip or its unzipped license/ files)
**/anygrasp_sdk
**/grasp_detection/license
licenseCfg.json
*.lic
*.public_key
*.signature
gsnet*.so
lib_cxx*.so
.TimeRecord
*.zip

# Editor / backup noise
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~
*.sw[a-p]
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
.cache/
.claude/
